{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/pulls/4","id":4852656324,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUZxf888AAAABIT2oxA","html_url":"https://github.com/gzers/opencodex-desktop/pull/4","diff_url":"https://github.com/gzers/opencodex-desktop/pull/4.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/gzers/opencodex-desktop/pull/4.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/issues/4","number":4,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix(updates): 保持面板查询后台提交并记录 Windows 夹具阶段","user":{"login":"gzers","id":22311504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMzExNTA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22311504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers","html_url":"https://github.com/gzers","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"面板版本查询的界面观察者取消后，已接受的后台任务继续持有存储准入并提交缓存、持久截止与终态事件。本分支基于已确认的 Windows 透明图标分支；四个面板修复文件与 release-details@fd31d716 相同，30 个图标路径与 bb3122d 原字节相同。此 PR 展示该增量与查询夹具诊断，不自动合并其他 PR。\n\n本地集成 Rust35组/892通过/6忽略，fmt/strict Clippy通过。观察者取消测试使用真实临时根 Schedule，但终态事件是受控标记，原生 IPC/通知投递仍待验。\n\n8be5b4cc 只增加 Windows 夹具阶段标记与 CI 的 --show-output；不预热或等待 Node，不改变生产代码、并发、两秒截止、所有权/退出码/清理断言。该 head 的 push CI38507499433失败：Windows库516通过/7失败/4忽略，七个版本/元数据夹具均未在查询结束前写出控制Node与父脚本启动标记；PR CI38508035604成功：Windows35组/620通过/7忽略，版本成功/非零退出约0.5秒，控制与父脚本启动标记已写出。Mac两轮各35组/892通过/6忽略。成功轮次不解除失败。\n\n独立控制Node未加入生产查询Job，其启动标记也缺失，需同时核查宿主调度/Node启动/文件写入；现有记录不足以确认根因或认定环境波动。原 fd/fb 失败和新失败全部保留，新候选打包没有触发。下一步在 Windows 固定源码执行后台诊断并留存阶段/进程证据，避开原生性能采样，不切换现有唯一原生实例。\n\n原macOS配对CPU/RSS失败、双平台原生、安装保留、真实更新/备份/事件、真实周期和FZ50许可门禁保持。保持草稿；没有签名、发布、stable晋升或完成证书。\n","created_at":"2026-10-14T03:47:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T05:45:37Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"f5f774dd47194fb2ea04a3b23e0ab3c75a71a6bd","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/pulls/4/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/pulls/4/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/issues/4/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/statuses/a7feba5fda9422cd177d31fefb18054b513524a2","head":{"label":"gzers:feature/0.1.10-integration-candidate","ref":"feature/0.1.10-integration-candidate","sha":"a7feba5fda9422cd177d31fefb18054b513524a2","user":{"login":"gzers","id":22311504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMzExNTA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22311504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers","html_url":"https://github.com/gzers","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_ad